{"parents": [], "prev": null, "next": null, "title": "Python native reference", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"module-greeter\">\n<span id=\"python-native-reference\"></span><h1>Python native reference<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-greeter\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>A real Sphinx autodoc input module.</p>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"greeter.Greeter\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"k\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">greeter.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">Greeter</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#greeter.Greeter\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Build personalized greetings without network access.</p>\n<p>Example:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"n\">greeter</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">Greeter</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">greeter</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">greet</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">'Docsy'</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"greeter.Greeter.greet\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">greet</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#greeter.Greeter.greet\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Greet a reader.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>name</strong> (<em>str</em>) \u2013 Reader name.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>A friendly greeting.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>str</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p>Example:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"n\">Greeter</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">greet</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">'Docsy'</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"greeter.Greeter.greet_checked\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">greet_checked</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#greeter.Greeter.greet_checked\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Reject an empty reader name.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>name</strong> \u2013 Reader name.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>A validated greeting.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>ValueError</strong> \u2013 When name is empty.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p>Example:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"n\">Greeter</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">greet_checked</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">'Ada'</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"greeter.Greeter.greet_many\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">greet_many</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">names</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">list</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">separator</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">'</span> <span class=\"pre\">/</span> <span class=\"pre\">'</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#greeter.Greeter.greet_many\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Greet several readers while preserving input order.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>names</strong> \u2013 Reader names.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>separator</strong> \u2013 Separator between greetings.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>Joined greetings.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p>Example:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"n\">Greeter</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">greet_many</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"s1\">'Ada'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s1\">'Linus'</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"greeter.Greeter.prefix\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">prefix</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">str</span></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'Hello'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#greeter.Greeter.prefix\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Greeting prefix used for future calls.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"]], "sourcename": "index.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Python native reference</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#greeter.Greeter\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Greeter</span></code></a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#greeter.Greeter.greet\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Greeter.greet()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#greeter.Greeter.greet_checked\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Greeter.greet_checked()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#greeter.Greeter.greet_many\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Greeter.greet_many()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#greeter.Greeter.prefix\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Greeter.prefix</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "has_maths_elements": false, "current_page_name": "index", "sidebars": ["about.html", "searchfield.html", "navigation.html", "relations.html", "donate.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0]}